  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43341212",
      "title": "Adding an Auth-only Layout",
      "lectureOrder": 221,
      "videoOrder": 207,
      "sourceHash": "0896c23a733fdb6381473c9233d8be5267938f0b9fa00f0016132bfb3dd932da",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 3.33,
          "en": "So how can we add a header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.33,
          "end": 7.14,
          "en": "that's only visible if the user is logged in?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.14,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "Well, as always, there would be multiple ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "One way of course would be to simply add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "to that training page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "But in many apps, you might have more than one page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 23.07,
          "en": "that should be accessible by logged in users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.913,
          "en": "So a better way to add such a header would be a layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 29.73,
          "en": "but I don't wanna use the root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.73,
          "end": 33.54,
          "en": "because then that logout button would be on all pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.54,
          "end": 36.603,
          "en": "even the login page, and it shouldn't be there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.59,
          "end": 40.11,
          "en": "So I want a specific layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.11,
          "end": 44.85,
          "en": "for all the pages that require user authentication,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.85,
          "end": 47.793,
          "en": "so that require a logged-in user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.66,
          "end": 51.66,
          "en": "And we can use a route group for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 53.7,
          "en": "And that's a feature about which you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.7,
          "end": 55.89,
          "en": "earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.89,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "You can create a route group by using brackets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "regular parentheses around some name of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 65.22,
          "en": "And then you can move all the pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.22,
          "end": 67.5,
          "en": "that should belong to this route group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.5,
          "end": 69.783,
          "en": "into that route group folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "Now this will not add a new segment to the URL path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 77.82,
          "en": "but it will group all these pages together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 81.78,
          "en": "And for example, does allow you to set up a layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.78,
          "end": 83.94,
          "en": "that will apply to all the pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.94,
          "end": 85.773,
          "en": "that belong to this route group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.18,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "And therefore, here we can now export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 91.383,
          "en": "a function called AuthLayout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 94.95,
          "en": "And this will receive a children prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.95,
          "end": 96.63300000000001,
          "en": "like all components will.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "And here we could now return a specific layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 102.923,
          "en": "for logged-in users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.923,
          "end": 107.013,
          "en": "or for pages that require logged in users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.36,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "Now, for that, I'll go to my root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 114.81,
          "en": "and copy this basic HTML snippet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.81,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "and actually also copy the metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "and this globals.css import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 122.31,
          "en": "because I still want styling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.31,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "And this will replace the root layout here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 127.8,
          "en": "because it's technically on the same level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.8,
          "end": 129.6,
          "en": "It's nested in a folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.6,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "but a folder that doesn't add a path segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 138.53,
          "en": "So it will replace it and act as a new root layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.72,
          "end": 142.95,
          "en": "And therefore it's this root layout structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.95,
          "end": 146.303,
          "en": "I want to use here and maybe name it AuthRootLayout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.07999999999998,
          "end": 151.529,
          "en": "And here in the body, I now want to add a header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.529,
          "end": 154.14,
          "en": "above the children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.14,
          "end": 156.36,
          "en": "And in that header I'll add a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.36,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "where I'll say welcome back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 161.13,
          "en": "And then below that paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.13,
          "end": 165,
          "en": "or visually it will be next to that paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165,
          "end": 168.21,
          "en": "I'll add a form where I want to have a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.21,
          "end": 169.623,
          "en": "that says, logout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 172.71,
          "en": "At the moment, it won't work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.71,
          "end": 175.35,
          "en": "but we'll take care of that soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.35,
          "end": 178.5,
          "en": "We also need to adjust this globals.css import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.5,
          "end": 180.3,
          "en": "and go up one level here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.3,
          "end": 184.02,
          "en": "because even though this won't add a path segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 188.31,
          "en": "to the URL, it's still a physical folder in our file system",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.31,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "and therefore seen relative from that layout.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 196.773,
          "en": "we need to go up one level to wrap those styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.63,
          "end": 201.12,
          "en": "With that, if you save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.12,
          "end": 203.703,
          "en": "you should see this header here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.66,
          "end": 206.34,
          "en": "Now, to get the right styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.34,
          "end": 211.29,
          "en": "I'll actually add an ID to it, auth-header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.29,
          "end": 214.95,
          "en": "That's some styling I prepared in advance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "And with that, that looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 219.873,
          "en": "Now let's make sure that this button works.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
